-  - **快路徑**: 把 `scripts/hooks/` + `scripts/install-hooks.sh` + `scripts/merge-claude-settings.py` 整套 copy 到新 repo,改 vault 名跟需要的 frontmatter 規範即可
-  - **手裝最小可用**:
